WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.275
Today we will connect the form of a useful object to its function. Our work connects

00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:07.496
with selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:13.903
Observe the pot rim, body, base and any decoration. Name a design choice that a

00:00:13.903 --> 00:00:15.748
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:19.198
Draw the outline using simple curved lines.

00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:23.049
Add a label showing how the pot might be used.
